# Personal-expenses-tracker-
Personal Expenses Tracker is a simple application used to record and manage daily expenses. It helps users track spending, organize expenses, and manage their budget easily.
Personal Expenses Tracker

---

1. PROJECT TITLE

Personal Expenses Tracker

---

2. PROJECT OVERVIEW

The Personal Expenses Tracker is a web-based application designed to help users manage and track their daily expenses efficiently. The system allows users to record expenses, categorize spending, monitor financial activities, and generate reports to maintain better budget control.

---

3. PROBLEM STATEMENT

Managing personal expenses manually can lead to poor financial planning, inaccurate calculations, and difficulty in tracking spending habits. A digital expense tracking system is required to maintain organized financial records and improve money management.

---

4. PROJECT OBJECTIVES

- Track daily expenses efficiently.
- Categorize expenses for better organization.
- Improve budget management.
- Reduce manual calculation errors.
- Generate expense reports easily.
- Monitor spending habits.

---

